  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.060" end="00:01.560" ttm:agent="v1">Ok, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:00.880" end="00:02.380" ttm:agent="v1">Always talk a lot</p>
      <p begin="00:01.940" end="00:04.670" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Yeah, I talk a lot (yo, Silo killed this shit)</p>
      <p begin="00:04.670" end="00:06.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Silo, punch me in)</p>
      <p begin="00:06.160" end="00:07.700" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we vibin'</p>
      <p begin="00:07.700" end="00:09.200" ttm:agent="v1">What would you like from me?</p>
      <p begin="00:09.030" end="00:10.770" ttm:agent="v1">What do you need?</p>
      <p begin="00:10.770" end="00:13.770" ttm:agent="v1">I'll do anything you ask, 'cause we vibin'</p>
      <p begin="00:13.770" end="00:15.270" ttm:agent="v1">What would you like from me?</p>
      <p begin="00:15.260" end="00:18.870" ttm:agent="v1">What do you need?</p>
      <p begin="00:18.870" end="00:22.010" ttm:agent="v1">When I get famous, you'll be my girl</p>
      <p begin="00:22.010" end="00:25.870" ttm:agent="v1">That's just brainless, that's just toss around</p>
      <p begin="00:25.870" end="00:28.930" ttm:agent="v1">Take that to the brain, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:28.930" end="00:30.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Take it to the brain)</p>
      <p begin="00:30.210" end="00:31.710" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(When I go)</p>
      <p begin="00:30.980" end="00:32.480" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, we vibin'</p>
      <p begin="00:32.260" end="00:33.760" ttm:agent="v1">What would you like from me?</p>
      <p begin="00:33.730" end="00:35.600" ttm:agent="v1">What do you need?</p>
      <p begin="00:35.600" end="00:38.350" ttm:agent="v1">I'll do anything you ask, 'cause we vibin'</p>
      <p begin="00:38.350" end="00:39.910" ttm:agent="v1">What would you like from me?</p>
      <p begin="00:39.910" end="00:41.670" ttm:agent="v1">What do you need?</p>
      <p begin="00:41.670" end="00:43.170" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I'll do anything)</p>
      <p begin="00:42.720" end="00:50.720" ttm:agent="v1">When I come around</p>
      <p begin="00:54.070" end="00:55.580" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:55.580" end="00:58.790" ttm:agent="v1">It's like you got me all wrong, wrong</p>
      <p begin="00:58.790" end="01:01.880" ttm:agent="v1">It's like you got me all wrong, yeah</p>
      <p begin="01:01.880" end="01:03.380" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I tried to lay out my peace (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:03.300" end="01:05.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">It's been worse how I mean (uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:05.230" end="01:06.730" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">She lookin' for love (love)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.410" end="01:07.920" ttm:agent="v1">She just want double C's</p>
      <p begin="01:07.920" end="01:09.890" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">This life, it come with some perks (perks)</p>
      <p begin="01:09.890" end="01:11.390" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">She turn to a fiend (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:11.200" end="01:13.050" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">If I give her this purse (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:13.050" end="01:14.550" ttm:agent="v1">That's all that she needs</p>
      <p begin="01:14.160" end="01:17.150" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">She just want rhapsody, pull up, put hands all on me (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:17.150" end="01:18.850" ttm:agent="v1">Pull up, come cancel your plans</p>
      <p begin="01:18.850" end="01:21.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'll put that bag in your hand (bag in your hand)</p>
      <p begin="01:21.080" end="01:29.080" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:49.390" end="01:52.030" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yo, Silo killed this shit)</p>
      <p begin="01:52.030" end="01:55.530" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Tell me that you love me (tell me that you love me)</p>
      <p begin="01:55.530" end="02:00.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Say it like you mean it (say it like you mean it)</p>
      <p begin="02:00.340" end="02:05.290" ttm:agent="v1">If I knew, if I knew</p>
      <p begin="02:05.290" end="02:10.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Everytime that I come around (ha-ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="02:10.340" end="02:17.400" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wait for your call, when I come around (ha-ah-ah-ah)</p>
      <p begin="02:17.400" end="02:21.430" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I wait on your call (yeah)</p>
      <p begin="02:21.430" end="02:23.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Wait, wait, make your ground spin)</p>
      <p begin="02:23.940" end="02:27.480" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I try to be funny, makin' money with my girlfriend)</p>
      <p begin="02:27.480" end="02:30.570" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(I cannot match, no, I cannot imagine)</p>
      <p begin="02:30.570" end="02:32.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">('Cause we're more than meets the eye)</p>
      <p begin="02:32.260" end="02:34.690" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Said we're more than meets the eye)</p>
      <p begin="02:34.690" end="02:41.630" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(When I come around)</p>
      <p begin="02:41.630" end="02:46.980" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(When I come around)</p>
      <p begin="02:46.980" end="02:51.260" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Yeah)</p>
